OL,3,ADrivers over 70 face eye tests every   
OL,4,Athree years under new plans            
OL,6,FTo drive legally in the UK, you must be
OL,7,Fable to read a standard number plate   
OL,8,Ffrom 20 metres away, wearing glasses or
OL,9,Fcontact lenses if required.            
